<title>UK: Woolwich to auction 23.1 pct of capital.</title>
<headline>Woolwich to auction 23.1 pct of capital.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Woolwich Building Society said on Friday that it would sell 370.21 million shares at auction, representing around 23.1 percent of its issued share capital.</p>
<p>The Woolwich floats on the London stock exchange on Monday.</p>
